OL,3,ANorth Korea and Russia open first road
OL,4,Abridge linking both countries
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes amid stronger ties between the
OL,7,Fcountries since the start of the
OL,8,FUkraine war, with Russia's Putin and
OL,9,FNorth Korea's Kim Jong Un previously
OL,10,Fpledging that they would help each
OL,11,Fother in the event of "aggression"
OL,12,Fagainst either country.
